{"rpid": "1661212336", "root": "1523804073", "parent": "1641857165", "uname": "alpha198", "mid": "37744750", "level": 5, "vip": 0, "content": "回复 @兰兰姐同桌 :电影《天堂真的存在》，根据真实事件改编。\n还有许多圣徒都能见到天堂，比如圣方济各。\n道教也有观灵术，凡人有缘都能亲自去看。 \nB站搜：天庭梦", "like": 0, "ctime": 1559806096, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "149790", "video_bvid": "BV1cx411w7nf", "video_title": "George Carlin 乔治·卡林 谈死亡和天堂", "video_desc": "渣浪 @Evan_LC19", "video_owner": "Soun", "video_view": 132085, "video_reply": 108, "video_n1": 43, "video_n2": 64}
